  {
   "id": "death-kid-331663@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "death-kid-331663",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-05T16:00:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The first update since full release has just dropped on Steam!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I’ve decided to add difficulty settings to the game: Easy and Normal!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Normal is the standard experience you're already familiar with.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Easy gives you double soul health, giving you more time to learn how to play efficiently and use abilities at the right moments. Enemy speed is also reduced by 10%—a small tweak, but it really helps!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "You can choose your difficulty at the start of a new game or change it anytime from the pause menu under Settings. Just keep in mind that you’ll need to restart your run for the change to take effect.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "After the update, please double-check your difficulty settings if you're already in the middle of the game!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The default difficulty is now set to Easy, so make sure to switch back to Normal if that's your preferred experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "For more experienced players, I’ve prepared some endgame content.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After completing a run and finishing the game, you'll be brought back to the HUB area, where you’ll find a mysterious statue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Activating the statue will unlock Challenge Mode, where the number of enemies is significantly increased.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are three levels of challenge—or four, if you completed the game on Easy mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "I highly recommend use every ability in your disposal to clear up hordes of enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "But hey, if you’re set on just spamming attack, no worries.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can upgrade your final skill, which gives you +10% damage every time you level it up, infinitely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And don’t worry about the XP grind. Once you've unlocked all previous skills, the XP threshold for leveling stays the same.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "So yeah, you’ll be just fine :p",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "I’ve also fixed a few issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Enemies now approach at the correct speed from all directions (previously they moved too slowly when coming from the top or bottom).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a strange bug where interactions would stop working if you quit to the main menu while inside an interaction trigger.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Big thanks to MoiQ for discovering that one!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "I also want to thank you for your support!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you don’t own the game yet, feel free to try out the demo!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you’re enjoying the game, please consider leaving a review on Steam — positive or negative, your feedback helps me improve the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you find any bugs or issues, don’t hesitate to let me know in the Community Hub!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Demo will be updated soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BYE!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
